### Create a customer
POST http://localhost:8080/api/customers
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Max",
  "lastName": "Mustermann"
}

### Create an account for the customer (replace {{customerId}} with UUID from above)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/accounts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": "{{customerId}}",
  "currency": "EUR",
  "overdraftLimit": 500.00
}

### Deposit money (replace {{accountId}} with UUID from above)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/accounts/{{accountId}}/entries
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: deposit-001

{
  "type": "CREDIT",
  "amount": 1000.00,
  "currency": "EUR",
  "description": "Initial deposit"
}

### Check account balance
GET http://localhost:8080/api/accounts/{{accountId}}

### Create a second account for transfers
POST http://localhost:8080/api/accounts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": "{{customerId}}",
  "currency": "EUR",
  "overdraftLimit": 0.00
}

### Transfer between accounts
POST http://localhost:8080/api/transfers
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: transfer-001

{
  "sourceAccountId": "{{accountId}}",
  "destinationAccountId": "{{secondAccountId}}",
  "amount": 250.00,
  "currency": "EUR",
  "description": "Rent payment"
}

### Replay the same transfer (idempotent - returns same result, no double-spend)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/transfers
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: transfer-001

{
  "sourceAccountId": "{{accountId}}",
  "destinationAccountId": "{{secondAccountId}}",
  "amount": 250.00,
  "currency": "EUR",
  "description": "Rent payment"
}

### View account statement (paginated ledger)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/accounts/{{accountId}}/entries?page=0&size=10

### Try overdraft (should return 422 Insufficient Funds)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/accounts/{{accountId}}/entries
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: overdraft-001

{
  "type": "DEBIT",
  "amount": 99999.00,
  "currency": "EUR",
  "description": "This should fail"
}
